<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel ups pulp price to 450 Ecu/tonne.</title>
<headline>Portucel ups pulp price to 450 Ecu/tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp group Portucel Industrial-Empresa Produtora de Celulose will raise the price of white eucalyptus pulp by 30 Ecus per tonne to 450 Ecus per tonne effective from October 1, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
